      "user_id": 0,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1765893445000000
    },
    {
      "text": "Thank you for holding. My name is Isaac. How can I help you today?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 301,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1765893454600000
    },
    {
      "text": "Hi, I need to start a return. Order number is VF88-21K40.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 14767,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1765893459200000
    },
    {
      "text": "Okay, I have your order right here. I see the VeloFit Ascent helmet. Can I ask what the issue is with the item?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 301,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1765893463200000
    },
    {
      "text": "The color is not what I expected. I don't need a discussion, I just need to know if I can return it. Yes or no?",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 14767,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1765893470800000
    },
    {
      "text": "Yes, you can. Just to confirm, is the box unopened?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 301,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1765893478400000
    },
    {
      "text": "Yes, it's untouched. It's been sitting here for a bit, but it's still sealed.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 14767,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1765893482000000
    },
    {
