      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 301,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1765893487333333
    },
    {
      "text": "Great. So you're sending a return label to the email on file?",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 14767,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1765893502599999
    },
    {
      "text": "That's correct. I've just processed the return authorization. The email with the shipping label is on its way to you now. Just print it, attach it to the box, and drop it off with the carrier.",
